@startuml data_submission
title Data Submission Phase

actor "Sender\n(S)" as S
database "IPFS" as IPFS
participant "Smart Contract\n(SC)" as SC
actor "Campaign Initiator \n (B)" as B
actor "Verifier\n(V)" as V

== Off-chain Operations (like before) ==

S -> S : Encrypt data with K_enc
S -> IPFS : Upload encrypted data
IPFS --> S : CID

S -> S : Compute CID_ciphered = Enc(CID, K_enc)

== On-chain Submission (edit) ==

S -> SC : Send (CID_ciphered, position)
SC -> SC : Validate sender, position,\nchunk and bond constraints \n Store data entry

SC -> B : Emit DataRequiredVerificationKeyGeneration(dataId)
V -> SC: request auth to verify

B -> B: Calculate CID = DEC(CID_ciphered, K_dec)
B -> IPFS: Request data from IPFS
IPFS --> B: Send data

B -> B: Generate\n (KD_enc, KD_dec)
B -> B: Encrypt data with KD_enc

B -> IPFS: Upload ciphered data on IPFS.
IPFS --> B: CID_V

B -> B: Calculate CID_V_ciphed = ENC(CID_V, PK_V)

B --> SC: publishDataKey(dataId, V, CID_V_ciphed)

SC -> V : Emit DataVerificationRequestedEvent(dataId)

@enduml